    "Cheetham Hill is closer to the city centre, with trams from Queens Road and a walk of around twenty minutes to Victoria, and it rewards people who love food and diversity. Gorton offers more green space, quieter residential streets and quick trains to Piccadilly. In both, conditions vary sharply from street to street, so viewing a home in person is essential.",
