    "Prestwich has more going on. Its main street, Bury New Road, has a growing number of independent restaurants, bars and cafés, and its village centre is being redeveloped with a new square. Heaton Park, one of the largest municipal parks in Europe, is at the end of the road, and Prestwich Clough runs down to the River Irwell.",
